# ivtest expected-failures list — consumed by .github/ivtest_gate.sh
# One test name per line; everything after the name is commentary.
# RULES (manifesto Phase 0): a test may only appear here with a
# written reason, and the gate fails BOTH on unexplained new failures
# and on stale entries. Full attribution: ivtest_vendored_baseline_*.txt
# and test_suite_audit_2026-07-17.md.
#
# --- Pre-existing upstream failures: NONE (was 31).
# --- The 2026-07-28 deep investigation found 29 of the 31 were verdict
# --- convention artifacts (the tests printed "PASS"; gold-less normal
# --- tests require the literal string "PASSED") and ran clean;
# --- sv_class_static_queue_pop_back used silence-as-success (no verdict
# --- print at all); sv_uarray_locator1 used `return' directly in an
# --- initial block, which is illegal (IEEE 1800-2017 13.4.4), so
# --- rejecting it was conformant -- the legal form passes. All 31
# --- tests were repaired and are now actively enforced.
#
# --- Documented fork divergences (13):
br1005		# implemented-feature divergence: fork legalizes queue-in-class (gold expects rejection)
br_ml20150315b		# implemented-feature divergence: fork legalizes the declaration form (gold expects rejection)
br_ml20180227		# implemented-feature divergence: fork legalizes the assignment form (gold expects rejection)
case_unique		# implemented-feature divergence: fork implements unique-case runtime checks; gold requires upstream's codegen sorry
func_empty_arg_fail4		# MISSING DIAGNOSTIC (roadmap R28): empty actual for a port with no default is accepted silently; test also uses an undeclared name
struct_invalid_member		# better-diagnostic divergence: fork names the unknown type; gold expects generic syntax error
sv_class_new_fail1		# MISSING DIAGNOSTIC (roadmap R28): `i = new' with non-class lvalue is accepted silently
sv_deferred_assert1		# implemented-feature divergence: fork implements deferred assertions; gold expects sorry
sv_deferred_assert2		# implemented-feature divergence: fork implements deferred assertions; gold expects sorry
sv_deferred_assume1		# implemented-feature divergence: fork implements deferred assumes; gold expects sorry
sv_deferred_assume2		# implemented-feature divergence: fork implements deferred assumes; gold expects sorry
sv_timeunit_prec_fail1		# implemented-feature divergence: LRM 5.7.1 digit separators in time literals + 1-line anchor drift (audit Part 12)
sv_timeunit_prec_fail2		# implemented-feature divergence: LRM 5.7.1 digit separators in time literals (audit Part 12)
